OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 25 NOV
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GThe Bournemouth Symphony
OL,6,     GOrchestra is joined by Jess
OL,7,     GGillam for a UK premiere, before
OL,8,     GMark Wigglesworth conducts
OL,9,     GBerlioz's Symphonie fantastique.
OL,10,G2145FThe Essay: Watching from the Wings
OL,11,     GDuring his acting career, Michael
OL,12,     GGoldfarb spent a lot of time
OL,13,     Gwatching from the wings, waiting
OL,14,     Gto go on stage. In this episode
OL,15,     Ghe talks about Maxim Gorky's play
OL,16,     GSummerfolk.
OL,17,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,18,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,19,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,20,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,21,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,22,     Geverything in between.
